{"obsah":"<p>The town of Litvínov invited us to its traditional St Michael's Festival, which takes place at several locations in this beautifully developing town. Our exhibition and workshop were in the centre of the sports zones in the local chateau park, right opposite the mobile stage. Unfortunately, as soon as we arrived it was clear that Vlasta, Martin and Matouš were in for a tough time. Rain, rain and a temperature you wouldn't send a dog out in. There was nothing to do but set everything up and wait until the afternoon to see if spectators would come.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The spectators came – and so did the rain. The guys and participants fought bravely, and even in total rain the workshop ran at full speed. We had to change the exhibition plan, and the first show took place on the stage, where Martin Šimůnek dared to jump even on the wet, slippery surface.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>About an hour later the sun peeked out for a moment, and Vlasta and Matouš got their bikes out to jump for the local TV crew. Vlasta then did a small demonstration on the stage and the jumps over the tape, finishing a little above 125 cm, which isn't bad at all given the conditions. Matouš warmed up on the obstacles, with the only condition being that he couldn't jump down to the ground, which was one big mud bath. He warmed up nicely, even with the spectators' support, but at the moment of the real exhibition what came? ….. A total cloudburst, which was also the end of this event. We simply did our best, the organiser thanked us and so did the spectators for our courage. Thanks for the invitation – and next year without rain.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2FLitvinov-FB-video.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2FLitvinov-FB-video.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212226\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309198038_458103419683735_5495285111433880916_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309198038_458103419683735_5495285111433880916_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212227\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309216096_458103539683723_8436650382260487495_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309216096_458103539683723_8436650382260487495_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212230\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309144398_458103343017076_2544094808013654387_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309144398_458103343017076_2544094808013654387_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212228\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309084346_458103386350405_979108856790073930_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F309084346_458103386350405_979108856790073930_n.webp?alt=media\"